 " \[LongDash] ",
 "whether a hypergraph is too big to draw, and so shown as a summary box"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"9ca9e5b3-41a6-6547-aa48-a1cd1e0c661d"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
